# Response templates for web requests (issue #918).
#
# URL navigation and frame-policy verdicts, HTTP fetch results, live web search
# result labels and the research follow-up statuses. Moved out of
# data/seed/multilingual-responses-synthesis.lino by category so each response
# file stays within 1500 lines. Placeholders in braces are filled by the handler.

multilingual_responses
  response response_web_open_in_new_tab_en
    intent web_open_in_new_tab
    language en
    text "I suggest opening this in a new tab: [{url}]({url})."
  response response_web_open_in_new_tab_ru
    intent web_open_in_new_tab
    language ru
    text "Предлагаю открыть это в новой вкладке: [{url}]({url})."
  response response_web_open_in_new_tab_hi
    intent web_open_in_new_tab
    language hi
    text "मेरा सुझाव है कि इसे नए tab में खोलें: [{url}]({url})।"
  response response_web_open_in_new_tab_zh
    intent web_open_in_new_tab
    language zh
    text "建议在新标签页中打开：[{url}]({url})。"
  response response_web_open_in_new_tab_es
    intent web_open_in_new_tab
    language es
    text "Te sugiero abrirlo en una pestaña nueva: [{url}]({url})."
  response response_web_url_navigate_native_note_en
    intent web_url_navigate_native_note
    language en
    text "In the browser web app, this URL is checked with browser-readable frame-policy metadata before any embedded preview is attempted. If X-Frame-Options or CSP frame-ancestors blocks embedding, the web app keeps the direct external link instead."
  response response_web_url_navigate_native_note_ru
    intent web_url_navigate_native_note
    language ru
    text "В браузерном веб-приложении этот URL проверяется по доступным браузеру метаданным политики фреймов, прежде чем пытаться показать встроенный предпросмотр. Если X-Frame-Options или CSP frame-ancestors блокируют встраивание, веб-приложение оставляет прямую внешнюю ссылку."
  response response_web_url_navigate_native_note_hi
    intent web_url_navigate_native_note
    language hi
    text "Browser web app में, कोई भी embedded preview आज़माने से पहले इस URL को browser-readable frame-policy metadata से जाँचा जाता है। अगर X-Frame-Options या CSP frame-ancestors embedding को रोकते हैं, तो web app इसके बजाय सीधा बाहरी लिंक रखता है।"
  response response_web_url_navigate_native_note_zh
    intent web_url_navigate_native_note
    language zh
    text "在浏览器 Web 应用中，尝试任何嵌入式预览之前，会先用浏览器可读的框架策略元数据检查此 URL。如果 X-Frame-Options 或 CSP frame-ancestors 阻止嵌入，Web 应用会改为保留直接的外部链接。"
  response response_web_url_navigate_native_note_es
    intent web_url_navigate_native_note
    language es
    text "En la aplicación web del navegador, esta URL se comprueba con metadatos de política de marcos legibles por el navegador antes de intentar cualquier vista previa incrustada. Si X-Frame-Options o CSP frame-ancestors bloquean la incrustación, la aplicación web conserva en su lugar el enlace externo directo."
  response response_web_frame_policy_blocked_en
    intent web_frame_policy_blocked
    language en
    text "I checked the page's frame policy, and it does not allow embedding here because {reason}."
  response response_web_frame_policy_blocked_ru
    intent web_frame_policy_blocked
    language ru
    text "Я проверил политику фреймов страницы: она не разрешает встраивание здесь, потому что {reason}."
  response response_web_frame_policy_blocked_hi
    intent web_frame_policy_blocked
    language hi
    text "मैंने पेज की frame policy जाँची, और यह यहाँ embed करने की अनुमति नहीं देती क्योंकि {reason}।"
  response response_web_frame_policy_blocked_zh
    intent web_frame_policy_blocked
    language zh
    text "我检查了该页面的框架策略，它不允许在这里嵌入，因为{reason}。"
  response response_web_frame_policy_blocked_es
    intent web_frame_policy_blocked
    language es
    text "Comprobé la política de marcos de la página y no permite incrustarla aquí porque {reason}."
  response response_web_frame_policy_unknown_en
    intent web_frame_policy_unknown
    language en
    text "I could not verify that this page allows embedding here because {reason}."
  response response_web_frame_policy_unknown_ru
